Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:58:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 129/191] [ae-patch] Fold merged and closed pull requests under
 a message into one row

A finished session ended on full Merged cards that repeated the TLDR's links and
needed nothing. Merged and closed pull requests under one assistant message now
fold into a single row ("3 merged #167 #161 #169"); opening it lists one titled
line per pull request, and opening a line shows its full card. Open and draft
pull requests keep the full card with Merge and the method choice, and a card
merged from this view stays a card with its after-merge note.
